From 061aa3ee1cdd93a4e2f0d244eb72175c2574f281 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 10:00:43 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(rfork): add bounded tensor layout diagnostics

Log compact per-stage layout summaries with fixed-size semantic and physical digests, aggregate storage metadata, and bounded tensor samples. Observe receiver layouts before reads and after transfer finalization without changing RFork acceptance or fallback behavior.

Signed-off-by: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
